@startuml SD-02 Load Registration Dashboard
title SD-02 Load Registration Dashboard

actor User
participant "Registration Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Asset API" as AssetAPI
participant "Node API" as NodeAPI
database "Database" as DB

User -> Dashboard: Open /dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: Check role access

alt Role can access assets
    Dashboard -> AssetAPI: GET /assets
    AssetAPI -> DB: Load assets
    DB --> AssetAPI: Asset list
    AssetAPI --> Dashboard: Assets
end

alt Role can access nodes
    Dashboard -> NodeAPI: GET /nodes
    NodeAPI -> DB: Load nodes
    DB --> NodeAPI: Node list
    NodeAPI --> Dashboard: Nodes
end

Dashboard -> User: Show role-based dashboard cards

@enduml